# Frontend env (NAMES ONLY — never put real values here).
# The browser holds NO secrets: it only ever talks same-origin to the Vite dev
# server, which proxies /healthz, /api, /auth, /webhook to the backend.
# Dev: copy to frontend/.env.local (git-ignored) ONLY if you need to override the
# proxy target (e.g. running `npm run dev` on a bare laptop instead of compose).

# --- Optional (have safe non-secret defaults) ---
BACKEND_ORIGIN=   # default: http://backend:8000  (compose service URL). Use http://localhost:8000 on a bare laptop.
